見たいな表情、傷や血はなし)\nhttps://x.com/ryonasastage3/status/1901681835501027336?s=46&t=lFoFVWjotG7Axzx-a2R9Gw\nケーブルや触手にスパークが出るほどの電流を流して電気責めの拷問をさせられる。\n表情はこちらをもっと痛み寄りにする感じにお願いします。\nhttps://x.com/ryonasastage3/status/1953505750333944175?s=46&t=lFoFVWjotG7Axzx-a2R9Gw\nぷすぷすと湯気が出た後に放心しながらおしっこを漏らしてしまい触手にかかる感じに", "nc": 57, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@RyonasaStage3/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3397137, "client_id": 311651, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b8336a55/uploads/origins/729e0e08-25e6-4805-8b25-0e6f28b6fae1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=935f8c8b27b7064b10d8abc47e6ffaa5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b8336a55/uploads/origins/729e0e08-25e6-4805-8b25-0e6f28b6fae1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=935f8c8b27b7064b10d8abc47e6ffaa5, https://si.imgix.net/b8336a55/uploads/origins/729e0e08-25e6-4805-8b25-0e6f28b6fae1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9528ef1bd890cc9505be3359144e2894 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b8336a55/uploads/origins/729e0e08-25e6-4805-8b25-0e6f28b6fae1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5e0fb63115e79a7bcf7d5a3eb36f19b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b8336a55/uploads/origins/729e0e08-25e6-4805-8b25-0e6f28b6fae1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a24740fabec3d0c941fdfec4d2a092e9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b8336a55/uploads/origins/729e0e08-25e6-4805-8b25-0e6f28b6fae1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a24740fabec3d0c941fdfec4d2a092e9, https://si.imgix.net/b8336a55/uploads/origins/729e0e08-25e6-4805-8b25-0e6f28b6fae1?bg=%23fff&auto